<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="description" content="Technologies and capabilities — Nicholas C. Taylor.">
    <title>Skills | Nicholas C. Taylor</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&family=Sora:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/header.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/skillsPage.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/skills-project-preview.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/footer.css">
    <script src="/js/header.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body class="skills-page">
    <%- include('../partials/header') %>
    <main>
        <section class="skills-hero" aria-labelledby="skills-heading">
            <div class="skills-hero-inner">
                <h1 id="skills-heading">Technologies &amp; <span>Capabilities</span></h1>
                <p class="skills-description">Building modern, scalable web applications with a focus on clean architecture, performance, and maintainable code.</p>
                <ul class="skills-technologies" aria-label="Core technologies">
                    <li><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
</svg><span>Full-Stack Development</span></li>
                    <li><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
</svg><span>TypeScript</span></li>
                    <li><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
</svg><span>Angular</span></li>
                    <li><svg width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
<path d="M5 12h14M5 12a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v4a2 2 0 01-2 2M5 12a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2m-2-4h.01M17 16h.01" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path>
</svg><span>Node.js</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="engineering-capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-heading">
            <div class="capabilities-inner">
                <div class="capabilities-heading">
                    <p class="capabilities-eyebrow">// Engineering Practices</p>
                    <h2 id="capabilities-heading">Engineering Capabilities</h2>
                    <p class="capabilities-description">Beyond frameworks and tools, my focus is on building software that is maintainable, reliable, and thoughtfully engineered.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="capabilities-grid">
                    <article class="capability-card">
                        <span class="capability-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        <h3>Application Architecture</h3>
                        <p>Designing modular applications with reusable components, service layers, routing, and clear separation of concerns.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="capability-card">
                        <span class="capability-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M8 9l3 3-3 3m5 0h3M5 20h14a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        <h3>API Development &amp; Integration</h3>
                        <p>Building RESTful APIs, implementing middleware, handling validation and errors, and integrating frontend and backend services.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="capability-card">
                        <span class="capability-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        <h3>Authentication &amp; Security</h3>
                        <p>Implementing authentication, authorization, password hashing, protected routes, and secure application configuration.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article class="capability-card">
                        <span class="capability-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                            <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path></svg>
                        </span>
                        <h3>Performance &amp; Reliability</h3>
                        <p>Troubleshooting application issues, improving maintainability, investigating failures, and applying reliability-focused engineering practices.</p>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="development-workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-heading">
            <div class="workflow-inner">
                <div class="workflow-heading">
                    <p class="workflow-eyebrow">// Methodology</p>
                    <h2 id="workflow-heading">Modern Development Workflow</h2>
                    <p class="workflow-description">Combining established engineering practices with AI-assisted tools to improve development efficiency and software quality.</p>
                </div>
                <ol class="workflow-stages" role="list">
                    <li class="workflow-stage">
                        <div class="workflow-stage-meta">
                            <span class="workflow-number">01</span>
                            <span class="workflow-label">Blueprint</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="workflow-stage-copy">
                            <h3>Plan</h3>
                            <p>Requirements, architecture, technical decisions &amp; schema design.</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="workflow-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="workflow-stage">
                        <div class="workflow-stage-meta">
                            <span class="workflow-number">02</span>
                            <span class="workflow-label">Execute</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="workflow-stage-copy">
                            <h3>Build</h3>
                            <p>Implementation, service integration, modular UI development.</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="workflow-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="workflow-stage">
                        <div class="workflow-stage-meta">
                            <span class="workflow-number">03</span>
                            <span class="workflow-label">Validate</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="workflow-stage-copy">
                            <h3>Test</h3>
                            <p>Endpoint validation, edge-case debugging, quality assurance.</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="workflow-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="workflow-stage">
                        <div class="workflow-stage-meta">
                            <span class="workflow-number">04</span>
                            <span class="workflow-label">Refine</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="workflow-stage-copy">
                            <h3>Review</h3>
                            <p>Code quality audits, maintainability review, refactoring.</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="workflow-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="workflow-stage workflow-stage-deploy">
                        <div class="workflow-stage-meta">
                            <span class="workflow-number">05</span>
                            <span class="workflow-label">Ship</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="workflow-stage-copy">
                            <h3>Deploy</h3>
                            <p>Version control pipeline, cloud delivery, production iteration.</p>
                        </div>
                        <span class="workflow-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                    </li>
                </ol>
                <div class="workflow-callout">
                    <span class="workflow-callout-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                            <path d="M9 18v3h7v-5a7 7 0 1 0-12-5l-2 3h3v4h4Z"/>
                            <path d="m12 6 .8 2.2L15 9l-2.2.8L12 12l-.8-2.2L9 9l2.2-.8L12 6Z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <p><strong>AI-Assisted Workflow Acceleration:</strong> AI-assisted tools accelerate implementation, exploration, and code review while engineering judgment remains central to architecture, testing, and delivery.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="experience-beyond-code" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
            <div class="experience-inner">
                <div class="experience-heading">
                    <p class="experience-eyebrow">// Multidisciplinary Background</p>
                    <h2 id="experience-heading">Experience Beyond the Code</h2>
                    <p class="experience-description">A multidisciplinary technical background spanning software development, systems reliability, data operations, and technical collaboration.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="experience-grid">
                    <article class="experience-card">
                        <div class="experience-card-heading">
                            <p class="experience-category">Operational Stability</p>
                            <span class="experience-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 12h4l3-7 4 14 3-7h4"/><path d="M4 4v16h16"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            <h3>Site Reliability &amp; Technical Support</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="experience-card-description">Experienced in live troubleshooting, incident management, triage, and operating critical production infrastructure under strict availability constraints.</p>
                        <ul class="experience-tags" role="list" aria-label="Site Reliability &amp; Technical Support skills">
                            <li>Troubleshooting</li>
                            <li>Incident Investigation</li>
                            <li>Operational Awareness</li>
                            <li>Systems Support</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                    <article class="experience-card">
                        <div class="experience-card-heading">
                            <p class="experience-category">Data Engineering</p>
                            <span class="experience-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="8" ry="3"/><path d="M4 5v14c0 4 16 4 16 0V5M4 12c0 4 16 4 16 0"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            <h3>Data Operations &amp; Systems</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="experience-card-description">Managing complex ETL pipelines, database migrations, scheduled backups, and ensuring enterprise-grade data consistency.</p>
                        <ul class="experience-tags" role="list" aria-label="Data Operations &amp; Systems skills">
                            <li>Data Refresh Workflows</li>
                            <li>System Dependencies</li>
                            <li>Data Integrity</li>
                            <li>Operational Processes</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                    <article class="experience-card">
                        <div class="experience-card-heading">
                            <p class="experience-category">Leadership &amp; Docs</p>
                            <span class="experience-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="3"/><path d="M3 21v-2a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v2M16 4a3 3 0 0 1 0 6M21 21v-2a6 6 0 0 0-4-5.65"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            <h3>Technical Training &amp; Collaboration</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="experience-card-description">Bridging engineering requirements with business stakeholders through lucid technical documentation, onboarding manuals, and knowledge sharing.</p>
                        <ul class="experience-tags" role="list" aria-label="Technical Training &amp; Collaboration skills">
                            <li>Technical Documentation</li>
                            <li>Knowledge Transfer</li>
                            <li>User Support</li>
                            <li>Cross-Functional Communication</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                    <article class="experience-card">
                        <div class="experience-card-heading">
                            <p class="experience-category">Application Delivery</p>
                            <span class="experience-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m7 9 3 3-3 3m6 0h4"/></svg>
                            </span>
                            <h3>Full-Stack Software Development</h3>
                        </div>
                        <p class="experience-card-description">End-to-end design and maintenance of modern web products with pragmatic stack selection, strict linting, and automated test coverage.</p>
                        <ul class="experience-tags" role="list" aria-label="Full-Stack Software Development skills">
                            <li>Frontend Development</li>
                            <li>Backend Integration</li>
                            <li>Feature Implementation</li>
                            <li>Application Maintenance</li>
                        </ul>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="skills-in-action" id="projects" aria-labelledby="skills-projects-heading">
            <div class="skills-projects-inner">
                <div class="skills-projects-heading">
                    <p class="skills-projects-eyebrow">// Applied Engineering</p>
                    <h2 id="skills-projects-heading">Skills in Action</h2>
                    <p class="skills-projects-description">Selected applications demonstrating how I apply technologies and engineering practices to real-world projects.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="skills-projects-grid">
                    <% for (const [index, project] of skillsProjects.slice(0, 2).entries()) { %>
                        <article class="skills-project-card" aria-labelledby="project-<%= project.id %>">
                            <div class="skills-project-info">
                                <div class="skills-project-meta">
                                    <span class="skills-project-number">Project <%= String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0') %></span>
                                    <span class="skills-project-status<%= project.status === 'Live Production' ? ' skills-project-status-live' : '' %>"><%= project.status %></span>
                                </div>
                                <h3 id="project-<%= project.id %>"><%= project.title %></h3>
                                <p class="skills-project-summary"><%= project.description %></p>
                                <ul class="skills-project-technologies" role="list" aria-label="<%= project.title %> technologies">
                                    <% for (const technology of project.technologies) { %>
                                        <li><%= technology %></li>
                                    <% } %>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <%- include('../partials/skills-project-preview', { project }) %>
                        </article>
                    <% } %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    <%- include('../partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
